-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +5</a>:</b> Passive: +5 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +2</a>:</b> Passive: +2 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a>:</b> <br />2 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a><br />3 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Corsair%27s_Bandana.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Corsair%27s_Bandana.png/420px-Corsair%27s_Bandana.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"339\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Corsair%27s_Bandana.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>A stylish bandana. Ownership of one like this is a sign of respect from the pirates of Three-Barrel Cove.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>The <a href=\"/page/Item:Pirate_Treasure_Map\" title=\"Item:Pirate Treasure Map\">Pirate Treasure Map</a>, the 3 items from the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a>:</b> <br />2 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a><br />3 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a></span></span> set, the 4 'Scoundrel's type' weapons and <a href=\"/page/Item:Brine_Shaman%27s_Staff\" title=\"Item:Brine Shaman&#39;s Staff\">Brine Shaman's Staff</a> have a chance of appearing in the end reward list of any of the <a href=\"/page/Three-Barrel_Cove_(heroic)\" title=\"Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)\">Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)</a> quests, except <a href=\"/page/Guard_Duty\" title=\"Guard Duty\">Guard Duty</a>. Every third completion you will receive a complete list.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817202644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.147 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4048/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25148/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7845/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n111.02%  141.486     48 Template:IO\n100.00%  127.443      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  127.443      1 -total\n 95.00%  121.075      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 37.10%   47.287      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.20%   46.140      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.49%   45.224      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.24%   43.639      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.49%   29.934      7 Template:Popup\n 15.87%   20.230      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24543-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817202644 and revision id 629171. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
